flowchart TD
  Start["Read tasks.md and parent PRD requirements"]
  Choose["Select dependency-eligible task from plan.json"]
  Discover["Inspect sources, close unknowns, record write scope"]
  Ready{"Contracts and dependencies sufficient?"}
  Parent["Revise parent plan and dependency edges"]
  Build["Reuse, recompose, extend verified gaps"]
  Verify["Check task acceptance and legacy behavior"]
  Passed{"Evidence supports completion?"}
  Record["Record implementation, tests and evidence"]
  Generate["Update manifest and regenerate tasks, ledger and DAG"]
  Gate{"Release gate evidence complete?"}
  Release["Record qualification verdict and rollout constraints"]
  Start --> Choose --> Discover --> Ready
  Ready -->|no| Parent --> Choose
  Ready -->|yes| Build --> Verify --> Passed
  Passed -->|defect| Build
  Passed -->|parent assumption wrong| Parent
  Passed -->|yes| Record --> Generate --> Gate
  Gate -->|not yet| Choose
  Gate -->|yes| Release --> Choose
